{"id":"634802","name":"豌豆凉粉条","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/634802/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豌豆粉","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"7碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火腿丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"熟花生米","amount":"几个"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好豌豆粉一碗。","img":"images/634802/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加一碗水，搅拌均匀至无干粉，调成面糊水。","img":"images/634802/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅，加6碗凉水，大火烧开。","img":"images/634802/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开后，慢慢加入调好的面糊水，不停的搅拌，以免糊底。","img":"images/634802/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"不停的搅拌，以免糊底。","img":"images/634802/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"至煮开。","img":"images/634802/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入大碗中，室温晾凉(不要放冰箱哦，放冰箱会反生)。","img":"images/634802/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"几个小时后，凉粉就好了。","img":"images/634802/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒扣出来。","img":"images/634802/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用刮刀旋转刮下来。","img":"images/634802/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"豌豆粉条就出来了。","img":"images/634802/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入碗中。","img":"images/634802/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入黄瓜丝、火腿丝、熟花生米。","img":"images/634802/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"另起碗，放入大蒜头碎、辣椒面、白芝麻、葱段。","img":"images/634802/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入盐、蚝油和生抽，泼上热油。","img":"images/634802/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"搅拌均匀，加入鸡精、香油和醋调味，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/634802/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"勺入豌豆粉条上。","img":"images/634802/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/634802/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"开吃了。","img":"images/634802/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}